  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communities are mobilized and Civil Society Organizations are agents of change. Train associations  in organizational  strengthening, women&apos;s  leadership, advocacy and citizen oversight. Relevant Activities include: capacity building of local partners to improve their management standards; producer associations improve their organizational practices; increase the participation of women in leadership positions; and the communities themselves take measures to improve municipal services and policies. Special attention will be given to the participation of women, youth and persons living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
